            "trigger": "after_word_ZH_W0036",
            "content_zh": "中国人见面时常说\"吃了吗？\"这不是真的问你吃饭没有，而是一种友好的问候。",
            "content_en": "Chinese people often greet with \"Have you eaten?\" This is not a real question about food, but a friendly greeting."
          },
