            "type": "文化对比",
            "trigger": "before_exercise_3",
            "content_zh": "在中国，握手时力度要适中，眼神要友善。太用力会显得粗鲁。",
            "content_en": "In China, handshakes should be moderate in strength with friendly eye contact. Too firm is considered rude."
          }
        ]
